== Part A: all 256 bytes -> ruling (job=DEBUG) ==
  SHIP                     4/256
  ADD_STATE              113/256
  ADD_MATERIAL            64/256
  RESHAPE                 17/256
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY      16/256
  RAISE_BUDGET            23/256
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE   4/256
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR        15/256
  single-bit rulings:
    BUILT    -> SHIP
    AMB      -> ADD_STATE
    UNREAD   -> ADD_MATERIAL
    NOTWIN   -> RESHAPE
    HIDDEN   -> CHANGE_GRANULARITY
    CAPPED   -> RAISE_BUDGET
    REFUTED  -> HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE
    SELF     -> SHIP
    (none)   -> SHIP

== Part B: situations the body can construct, per call site ==
  loop.py:217 _rule(): BUILT=True, AMB=set_amb|sites>1, CAPPED=capped
      BUILT                  -> SHIP
      BUILT+CAPPED           -> RAISE_BUDGET
      BUILT+AMB              -> ADD_STATE
      BUILT+AMB+CAPPED       -> ADD_STATE
  loop.py:391 confirm-runs disagree: HIDDEN=True
      HIDDEN                 -> CHANGE_GRANULARITY
  guard.py:491 no candidates & no pytest-cov: UNREAD=True
      UNREAD                 -> ADD_MATERIAL
  guard.py:539 escalation gate: CAPPED=capped0, REFUTED=acts0
      (none)                 -> SHIP
      REFUTED                -> HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE
      CAPPED                 -> RAISE_BUDGET
      CAPPED+REFUTED         -> RAISE_BUDGET
  guard.py:612/618 refusal wording: REFUTED=True
      REFUTED                -> HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE
  cli.py:474 selfcheck: each of BUILT/AMB/UNREAD/CAPPED/REFUTED alone
      BUILT                  -> SHIP
      AMB                    -> ADD_STATE
      UNREAD                 -> ADD_MATERIAL
      CAPPED                 -> RAISE_BUDGET
      REFUTED                -> HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE

== Part C: acts the body can ever receive from a decide() call ==
  SHIP                   REACHABLE
  ADD_STATE              REACHABLE
  ADD_MATERIAL           REACHABLE
  RESHAPE                never returned to the body
  CHANGE_GRANULARITY     REACHABLE
  RAISE_BUDGET           REACHABLE
  HARVEST_COUNTEREXAMPLE REACHABLE
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR       never returned to the body

== bytes that rule each act the body never receives ==
  RESHAPE: 17 bytes; e.g. NOTWIN, BUILT+NOTWIN, BUILT+NOTWIN+HIDDEN, BUILT+NOTWIN+CAPPED, BUILT+NOTWIN+HIDDEN+CAPPED, BUILT+NOTWIN+REFUTED
  AUTHOR_SUCCESSOR: 15 bytes; e.g. NOTWIN+HIDDEN, NOTWIN+CAPPED, NOTWIN+HIDDEN+CAPPED, NOTWIN+REFUTED, NOTWIN+HIDDEN+REFUTED, NOTWIN+CAPPED+REFUTED
